   "label": "Allow UOM change on invoice lines",
   "default": "1",
   "description": "Master switch. On, the driver can switch a line between the item's own UOMs (Pcs / Box / Carton) and the rate re-fetches. Off, every line sells in the item's stock UOM. Individual vans can override this."
